Modifications
-------------
The armsense build modifies the upstream source trees before compiling them.
The modifications are applied by the scripts in build/src (rename of the
product, removal of upstream branding and vendor service hooks), build/ports
(replacement of components fetched from the vendor's private server, port
renames, default configuration) and build/kernel (kernel configuration).
Every file in a distributed armsense image that differs from its upstream
version was changed by one of those scripts; the scripts and this repository
constitute the record of the changes.
